# T3 Chat's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-t3chat-setting-cookie = Your t3.chat browser session. Sign in at https://t3.chat, open Developer Tools → Application → Cookies → https://t3.chat, and copy every cookie there (the session cookies change names between releases), pasted as one header: "name=value; name2=value2". It is sent only to t3.chat.

## The report: the overage window and the plan's usage band and
## subscription status. Plan names, the band, and the status stay as T3
## Chat sends them.

usage-t3chat-overage = Overage
usage-t3chat-plan = Plan
usage-t3chat-usage-band = Usage band
usage-t3chat-subscription = Subscription
